scenario: Negative expense is rejected before touching the ledger

#1 - TripSettlementService.recordExpense(tripName, expense) !! InvalidExpenseException
  #1.1 - ExpenseValidator.ensureValid(expense) !! InvalidExpenseException
#2 - TripSettlementService.settleTrip(tripName) → value
  #2.1 - TripLedger.expensesOf(tripName) → value
  #2.2 - BalanceCalculator.computeBalances(expenses) → value
  #2.3 - SettlementPlanner.planTransfers(balances) → value
